script = ExtResource("9_xx6kw")
title = "O'Shaughnessy Dam"
text = "3,800 feet. Congress passed the Raker Act in 1913 to dam the Tuolumne River here for San Francisco's water supply, over John Muir's fierce opposition. The dam was finished in 1923 and raised 85 feet in 1938. The valley floor beneath the water once held oak groves and meadows much like Yosemite Valley."

